## 1. Task overview

**One-sentence description:** {{TASK_DESCRIPTION}}
<!-- TASK_DESCRIPTION: what this prompt classifies, in plain English.
     E.g. "classify customer support tickets as billing-related or
     not." Filled by user during /spp-init consultation. -->

**Audience for the prompt's output:** {{AUDIENCE}}
<!-- AUDIENCE: who or what consumes the classifications downstream.
     E.g. "internal triage queue", "alerting pipeline", "human review
     team." Affects metric choice (precision vs recall) downstream. -->

**Problem statement** (2–3 sentences on why this task matters and
what currently goes wrong without it):
{{PROBLEM_STATEMENT}}
<!-- PROBLEM_STATEMENT: filled by user during /spp-init. The designer
     should push back if the answer is fewer than two sentences or
     conflates the task with the metric. -->

