## 6. Baseline

**Data source:** {{DATA_SOURCE}}
<!-- DATA_SOURCE: where rows come from (file, query, sampling
     procedure). Filled during consultation. -->

**Target baseline size:** {{BASELINE_TARGET_SIZE}} rows
<!-- BASELINE_TARGET_SIZE: typically 50–100 (DESIGN.md README "When
     to use this"). Stripped-scope plans may go smaller; document
     why if so. -->

**Class balance target:** {{CLASS_BALANCE_TARGET}}
<!-- CLASS_BALANCE_TARGET: e.g. "50/50 binary" or "preserve
     production prevalence." Affects stratified split. -->

**Label provenance:** {{LABEL_PROVENANCE}}
<!-- LABEL_PROVENANCE: who labels and how disagreements get
     resolved. Inputs to baseline-quality. -->

**Status:** {{BASELINE_STATUS}}
<!-- BASELINE_STATUS: one of {not-started, in-progress, complete}.
     Updated by /spp-baseline; /spp-loop refuses to start if
     "complete" is not present. -->

